{"word":"φεύγω","uri":"pheugô","senses":[{"word":"φεύγω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">φεύγω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">φεύξομαι,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ao. 2</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἔφυγον</span> [<span class=\"grec-longueur\">ῠ</span>] <span class=\"ital\">pf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πέφευγα,</span> <span class=\"ital\">pass.\nao.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐφεύχθην,</span> <span class=\"ital\">pf.</span> <span class=\"grec\">πέφυγμαι</span>)\n<div class=\"Rub\"><span class=\"Ruba\">A</span>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> fuir, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d. :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">intr.</span> prendre la fuite, <span class=\"ital\">abs.</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">διώκω,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">22, 157,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">le lieu d’où l’on fuit avec <span class=\"grec\">ἀπό, ἐκ</span> ou <span class=\"grec\">ὑπέκ</span> et le gén.\nou avec le gén. seul :</span> <span class=\"grec\">φ. ἀπό\nτινος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">12,\n120,</span> fuir loin de qqn ; <span class=\"grec\">ἀπὸ τῶν\nτειχῶν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 2, 4,</span> fuir des\nremparts ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐκ πολέμοιο,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 118 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 589,</span> s’enfuir du combat ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐκ\nθανάτοιο,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">20, 350,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> échapper à\nla mort ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐκ κακῶν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span> <span class=\"refch\">437 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὑπὲκ κακοῦ,</span> <span c